dialogue prologue_camp
title: Camp at the Ford
trigger: Prologue Camp
backdrop: greenvalley
speaker commander $commander
speaker knight knight
speaker barbarian barbarian
speaker cleric cleric

node dusk commander
  Dusk comes down over the reeds at the ford. Nobody follows you from the bridge.
  -> meal

node meal cleric
  Eat something and sleep. Nobody is hurt worse than tired, and tired mends by morning.
  -> knight

node knight knight
  He showed us his plate and his flanks and dared us to try. Going round him gets us nowhere.
  -> through

node through barbarian
  I don't need to go round it. I need to go through it. Show me where a plate like that is weakest, and I'll learn the swing tonight.
